@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Native database — ensure daily partitions (yesterday … +7 days)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestNativeDatabase/EnsurePartitions?daysAhead=7

### Native database — bulk merge 60 minute rows for source 1 (re-run updates the same rows)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestNativeDatabase/WriteMetrics?sourceId=1&count=60

### Native database — range query
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestNativeDatabase/GetMetrics?sourceId=1&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2030-01-01T00:00:00Z

### Native database — delete rows of source 1
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestNativeDatabase/DeleteMetrics?sourceId=1

### Platform event — publish to own domain (handled by SamplePlatformEventHandler)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestPlatformEvent/Publish
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "http-examples"
}

### Scheduler simulation — same call as BiApp.Scheduler RunScheduledTaskService (PublishEvent via Configuration event definition)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestSchedulerEvent/Trigger?eventCode=test2-sample-event&applicationId=5abc0777-19ff-5993-b71e-38cc9f7673a2&tenantId=c5ee1829-675a-59e8-bd7e-4fe2e941776a

### Platform event — last received event (stored in Redis by the handler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestPlatformEvent/GetLastReceived

### Redis lock — acquire (409 when already held)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestRedis/AcquireLock/sample-lock?seconds=30

### Redis lock — release with the returned token (409 for a wrong token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/test/TestRedis/ReleaseLock/sample-lock/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000